{"id":"wb-3-38","name":"陈嘉庚墓","retrievedAt":"2026-11-06T11:54:03+00:00","status":"ready","title":"陈嘉庚墓","text":"陈嘉庚墓，是著名的华侨领袖、著名实业家、教育家和社会活动家陈嘉庚的墓葬。该墓葬位于中华人民共和国福建省厦门市集美区鳌园内的集美解放纪念碑南侧，始建于1955年，1961年陈嘉庚去世后葬入该墓中。该墓坐北朝南的墓表呈龟形，墓南侧建有一座墓碑，北侧建有马蹄形的半环绕的墓圹，上面镶嵌有介绍陈嘉庚生平的浮雕。墓的南侧建有祭台和拜堂。1988年，陈嘉庚墓被列为全国重点文物保护单位。","shortened":false,"sourceUrl":"https://zh.wikipedia.org/wiki/%E9%99%88%E5%98%89%E5%BA%9A%E5%A2%93","revisionId":86856467,"revisionUrl":"https://zh.wikipedia.org/w/index.php?oldid=86856467","license":"CC BY-SA 4.0","licenseUrl":"https://creativecommons.org/licenses/by-sa/4.0/","authors":"维基百科贡献者","matchEvidence":"名称与地理坐标一致","image":{"path":"assets/wikipedia/8ea42e9db69a16711d3d29c3.jpg","title":"陳嘉庚墓.jpg","sourceUrl":"https://commons.wikimedia.org/wiki/File:%E9%99%B3%E5%98%89%E5%BA%9A%E5%A2%93.jpg","originalUrl":"https://upload.wikimedia.org/wikipedia/commons/2/28/%E9%99%B3%E5%98%89%E5%BA%9A%E5%A2%93.jpg?utm_source=commons.wikimedia.org&utm_campaign=imageinfo&utm_content=original","author":"寺人孟子","license":"CC BY-SA 4.0","licenseUrl":"https://creativecommons.org/licenses/by-sa/4.0","caption":"​陳嘉庚墓,福建省廈門市集美區集美街道潯江社區","width":320,"height":213}}